    <mxCell id="key" value="&lt;b&gt;Edges&lt;/b&gt;&#10;1  runtime loads the agent definition + always-on rules&#10;2  agent resolves a capability suffix: session tool list first, then opencode.json (V1, then V2)&#10;3  active → conversion mirror: HAND-AUTHORED. No generation script exists today (OI-07); a blind copy would change packaged behaviour&#10;4  conversion → extension: &lt;code&gt;npm run copy-resources&lt;/code&gt; (extension/scripts/copy-resources.js, mapping &lt;code&gt;conversions → resources&lt;/code&gt;)&#10;5  validator scans all four roots read-only, with the three named exclusion globs&#10;6  validator writes the report artefact (the only write it performs)&#10;7  gate reads counts; it never re-runs the scan&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;  blue = untracked active workspace · green = tracked mirror · red = untracked-config risk · purple = validation &amp;amp; gate · orange = runtime &amp;amp; external system" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
